; Probe 1 of the caret arc: `(^Name: T): (body)` reparents every body edge
; under Name (AGENTS.md:107). The reader groups the top-level `(edge): (body)`.
;
; `dl8 expand` gives (: User (* (: name str))) and the 4-item
; (: User greet (<- ...)). `dl8 compile` is rc=1, undeclared_relation(<-):
;   src/_2_lower/_1_forms.rs:70     `bind_form` takes exactly 3 items.
;   src/_3_check/_1_graph.rs:60     arity counts every edge an owner holds.
;   AGENTS.md:92                    a labelled rule is not a form.

(^User: (* (: name str))): (
  (: greet (<- (greet ?User ?Out) (User ?User ?Name) (str.cons "hi " ?Name ?Out)))
)
